# Search-tool ignore file (ripgrep/ag/fd respect this; git does NOT).
# Token-efficiency: keeps high-noise, low-signal tracked paths out of agent
# grep/glob results without affecting what git tracks. Deliberately CONSERVATIVE
# — it never hides live source. If you need to search an excluded path, pass
# `rg -uu` / `rg --no-ignore` or grep it directly.

# Generated lockfiles (mechanical, thousands of lines)
**/package-lock.json
**/yarn.lock
uv.lock
**/Package.resolved

# Image/screenshot galleries (binary; rg skips them anyway, listed for fd/ls)
**/screenshots/
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.webp
*.gif

# Archived / historical trails — read their INDEX.md instead of grepping them
docs/plans/archive/
todos/archive/

# Generated coverage / build reports if ever present in-tree
**/coverage.xml
build/
